{{ENExclusive}}
'''Dotty Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by purchasing it from a special sale during the [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 745
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Dotty Cat
|name2 = Birthday Dotty Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Birthday Dotty Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
To put it simply, Dotty Cat is almost entirely outclassed by [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] outside of '''very''' niche situations. It has lower anti-Angel health, since it only has [[Strong Against|Strong]] instead of [[Resistant]], a slower recharge and a higher cost. While it does have higher base health than Ramen Cat, Ramen Cat is able to benefit from + levels, on top of having [[Talents]].

That being said, it is slightly more effective than Ramen Cat against Angels that can Slow or Knockback, such as [[Angelic Sleipnir]], [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]] or [[Sunfish Jones]]. While using it against non-Angel enemies is generally a bad idea, there may be a few cases where its immunities can come in handy, for example when fighting [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]] or [[Firecracker]], though [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]] can do the same using Talents.

Overall, this unit is likely not worth spending money on outside of collection, since there are many stronger and more accessible options for its meatshield role.

